  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: Common acceleration $=\\frac{3}{3}=1 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{sec}^2$\n<img src=\"assets\\st0025_7c9a5d4366f1.png\"><br>\n$$\n\\mathrm{N}_1=1 \\mathrm{~N}\n$$"
